## Future Automation

When `/consolidate-brain` runs with full API access, this export can be automated:
1. Detect new `BLOG_*.md` files
2. Bundle with media
3. Push to Astro repo via GitHub API
4. Trigger Netlify/Vercel build

This creates a **fully agentic publishing pipeline**.
